  "title": "Fans Talk",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"post-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2011-12-24\" class=\"post-date entry-date updated\">December 24, 2011</time>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title entry-title\"><a href=\"/fans-talk\">Fans Talk</a></h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-author\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/kathy\" rel=\"author\">kathy</a></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-category\"><a href=\"/category/main\" rel=\"category tag\">main</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n        \t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Fan support is a key to the popularity and growth of any sport, and sled dog racing is no exception. Since his first win, George Attla has viewed his sports figure role as an obligation in exchange for the privilege to race. Over his long racing career, he embraced his role and never missed an opportunity to help the media inform the public about sled dog racing. In being recognized as a significant competitor, he made a commitment to work hard to prepare for every race and give it his all. The fans noticed. View here what fans gave in return.</span></p><div id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-162 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-22.png\"><img src=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-22.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail attla-content-img\" alt=\"poem\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1169\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-1-1169\">\n\t\t\t\t1987- William Fitzgerald poem\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-21.png\"><img src=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-21.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail attla-content-img\" alt=\"Virginia Kraft at Rondy\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1167\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-1-1167\">\n\t\t\t\t1978- Robert Levine drawing\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-14.png\"><img src=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-14.png\" class=\"tf_svg_lazy attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail attla-content-img\" alt=\"2008 Shelia Langford front\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-15.png\"><img src=\"/images/attla/2011/12/Picture-15.png\" class=\"tf_svg_lazy attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail attla-content-img\" alt=\"Shelia card back\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1156\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-1-1156\">\n\t\t\t\t2008.04- Shelia Langford card to George\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure>\n\t\t</div>\n<p></p>\n<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-162\" data-postid=\"162\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-162 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    </div>\n<!--/themify_builder_content-->\n\n\t    \n\t</div><!-- /.entry-content -->\n\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /.post-content -->"
